{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32394","headline":"秋日旅舍寄义山李侍御 · 温庭筠","name":"秋日旅舍寄义山李侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一水悠悠隔渭城，渭城风物近柴荆。\n寒蛩乍响催机杼，旅雁初来忆弟兄。\n自爲林泉牵晓梦，不关砧杵报秋声。\n子虚何处堪消渴，试向文园问长卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32394.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32394","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}